atures out of harm's way and into salvation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338020/extras/Animal_Run.gif?t=1744918972\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make use of the spirit mist to transport objects or alter its path to change the direction of the flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stomp down the dark claws to clear out a safe route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a select bunch of handcrafted songs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">150+ Puzzles using a combination of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 different animals, each with their own reactions and interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 different types of log, from standard to polarising.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A HAND-full of traps that want to eat the souls of the lost and occasionally lend a helping HAND.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rivers, and their many PITfalls and uses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338020/extras/Mist_Crow.gif?t=1744918972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join our Community to stay up to date with news and puzzles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["SpiceBound Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338020/1a4843d6679826388996b12742885d253640b908/header.jpg?t=1744918972","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Mi